6
00:01:04,370 --> 00:01:06,370
[Lim Youngmin]

7
00:01:07,160 --> 00:01:09,760
[Lee Donggeon]

8
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:15,100
[Wintertime]

9
00:01:18,580 --> 00:01:20,380
Why are you here?

10
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:24,330
