13
00:01:35,270 --> 00:01:37,160
Make sense, Seunghyuk?

14
00:01:39,940 --> 00:01:44,520
The chairman gave you a great opportunity.

15
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:46,910
Just do what you're told.

16
00:01:47,060 --> 00:01:48,910
Don't try anything funny.

17
00:01:51,930 --> 00:01:53,240
By the way...

18
00:01:59,039 --> 00:02:01,190
who was that guy just now?

19
00:02:01,190 --> 00:02:03,350
What a cutie.

20
00:02:24,590 --> 00:02:26,200
Fire Kwon Yihyun.

21
00:02:27,030 --> 00:02:28,160
Noted.

22
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:29,670
Also,

23
00:02:30,740 --> 00:02:32,800
