24
00:02:33,030 --> 00:02:34,220
Noted.

25
00:02:35,670 --> 00:02:36,960
Sorry?

26
00:02:39,050 --> 00:02:41,450
Didn't you hear Gu Jinhyuk
call him a cutie?

27
00:02:44,750 --> 00:02:45,970
Yes, noted.

28
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:59,810
[Soobin-hyung]

29
00:03:12,010 --> 00:03:13,240
Yeah.

30
00:03:14,490 --> 00:03:16,340
I'll go get my things in a bit.

31
00:03:23,210 --> 00:03:24,550
I'm hanging up.

32
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,420
What are you doing?

33
00:03:46,740 --> 00:03:50,130
Hey, I'm talking to you.

34
00:03:50,370 --> 00:03:51,890
I'm here to get my things.

35
00:04:01,610 --> 00:04:06,390
Hey, you're that gay, right?

36
00:04:09,140 --> 00:04:11,640
Perfect timing. Our boss is here too.

37
00:04:12,450 --> 00:04:14,670
After causing all that mess,

38
00:04:16,950 --> 00:04:20,180
