apologize to him before you leave.

39
00:04:20,180 --> 00:04:21,339
Don't you think?

40
00:04:29,030 --> 00:04:30,230
Boss,

41
00:04:30,590 --> 00:04:32,500
we have an interesting guest.

42
00:04:45,190 --> 00:04:47,060
Why are you here at this hour?

43
00:04:50,310 --> 00:04:52,300
I came to get my things.

44
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:55,210
I got fired thanks to someone.

45
00:05:00,810 --> 00:05:02,120
Is that all?

46
00:05:03,340 --> 00:05:04,900
Should I take

47
00:05:05,170 --> 00:05:08,030
