keep this?

51
00:05:24,590 --> 00:05:25,980
Kwon Yihyun.

52
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:29,860
There's something interesting
in your wallet.

53
00:05:36,730 --> 00:05:39,800
Clinging on to this old thing? Pathetic.

54
00:05:40,290 --> 00:05:42,950
Don't the guys you date
buy condoms themselves?

55
00:05:46,690 --> 00:05:50,680
Just buy a new one.
I'll give you the money.

56
00:06:00,960 --> 00:06:03,080
Aren't you proud of yourself?

57
00:06:03,670 --> 00:06:06,530
Offering dirty money you make
by beating people up.

58
00:06:11,730 --> 00:06:14,760
And hooker money is so clean?

59
00:06:16,890 --> 00:06:19,020
Get off your high horse.

60
00:06:24,210 --> 00:06:26,020
Is 50,000 won enough? (~US$40)

61
00:06:32,590 --> 00:06:34,690
I'll pay for your service too.

62
00:06:37,380 --> 00:06:38,860
Not for me personally.

63
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:41,920
That's too disgusting.

64
00:06:42,780 --> 00:06:45,100
I'll find a decent guy to sleep with you.

65
00:06:51,470 --> 00:06:52,770
Gu Seunghyuk.

66
00:06:55,350 --> 00:06:57,680
You've completely changed.

67
00:06:57,810 --> 00:06:59,850
You're a total rotten scumbag now.

68
00:07:03,420 --> 00:07:05,680
No need to be so hostile.

69
00:07:18,880 --> 00:07:20,470
Take that and go.

70
00:07:25,850 --> 00:07:27,360
And Yihyun,

71
00:07:30,530 --> 00:07:33,150
let's not meet again.

72
00:08:08,180 --> 00:08:11,860
Hey, Yihyun. It's Mom.

73
00:08:14,210 --> 00:08:16,090
Sorry you had to wait.

74
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:28,620
Have you eaten?

75
00:08:29,650 --> 00:08:31,120
Yihyun,

76
00:08:32,150 --> 00:08:35,240
your dad is in the hospital.

77
00:08:37,280 --> 00:08:39,000
He has liver cancer.

78
00:08:43,690 --> 00:08:45,270
How long has it been?

79
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:50,660
Not long. About a month.

80
00:08:51,920 --> 00:08:53,630
Is he receiving treatment?

81
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:56,410
He is,

82
00:08:56,780 --> 00:09:00,630
but the tumor is in a hard-to-reach spot.

83
00:09:01,950 --> 00:09:03,730
So I was wondering

84
00:09:04,130 --> 00:09:06,870
if you have any savings.

85
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,650
What?

86
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:12,660
I know

87
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:15,490
I shouldn't be asking you for money,

88
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:17,090
but

89
00:09:17,380 --> 00:09:19,540
your sister told me

90
00:09:19,670 --> 00:09:24,680
you've been working a lot of jobs.

91
00:09:26,690 --> 00:09:29,130
In about a year,

92
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:34,410
