should be available.

93
00:09:39,680 --> 00:09:41,980
Son, I'm sorry.

94
00:09:42,110 --> 00:09:44,360
I shouldn't have brought this up.

95
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:51,530
If you're juggling
multiple part-time jobs,

96
00:09:51,650 --> 00:09:53,170
you must be tight on money.

97
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,790
It's okay.

98
00:09:55,090 --> 00:09:57,350
I'll figure something out.

99
00:09:59,650 --> 00:10:01,170
I'm sorry.

100
00:10:08,490 --> 00:10:09,680
What?

101
00:10:11,800 --> 00:10:13,230
What did you ask for?

102
00:10:13,350 --> 00:10:17,180
Severance pay.
I worked here for three years.

103
00:10:17,430 --> 00:10:20,420
That means I should get severance.

104
00:10:21,160 --> 00:10:22,600
Are you kidding me?

105
00:10:24,290 --> 00:10:27,950
Are you out of your mind?

106
00:10:29,060 --> 00:10:30,400
Bloody hell.

107
00:10:36,020 --> 00:10:38,660
Didn't I say
I don't want to see you again?

108
00:10:42,550 --> 00:10:44,810
What other business could you have here?

109
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:52,670
Severance pay?

110
00:10:54,600 --> 00:10:58,020
As far as I know, you get severance
if you work for more than a year.

111
00:10:58,020 --> 00:11:01,220
You didn't even sign a work contract.
What severance?

112
00:11:01,830 --> 00:11:04,890
You're talking like
this is some legit corporate job.

113
00:11:08,180 --> 00:11:09,500
Yihyun,

114
00:11:10,070 --> 00:11:11,960
if you need money,

115
00:11:12,090 --> 00:11:15,860
don't use sad excuses like severance.

116
00:11:16,750 --> 00:11:19,950
Just ask me for help straight up.

117
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:26,710
Show how desperate you are
that you'd even take dirty blood money.

118
00:11:28,420 --> 00:11:31,530
What, can't do it?

119
00:11:36,970 --> 00:11:38,180
Right,

120
00:11:38,310 --> 00:11:41,720
you've always been
too proud to take free money.

121
00:11:44,730 --> 00:11:46,330
Boring.

122
00:11:46,330 --> 00:11:47,930
Just leave.

123
00:11:54,490 --> 00:11:55,770
Please help me.

124
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:04,320
Lend me some money.

125
00:12:11,170 --> 00:12:14,120
You're the only one I can turn to.

126
00:12:28,860 --> 00:12:33,200
Fine, I'll lend you the money.

127
00:12:41,080 --> 00:12:42,800
But I have one condition.

128
00:12:45,990 --> 00:12:48,090
Let's pull off a job together.

129
00:12:49,010 --> 00:12:52,120
[Promissory Note]

130
00:12:50,380 --> 00:12:52,130
I was actually in quite a bind.

131
00:12:52,890 --> 00:12:57,540
The plan has been ready to go for a while,
but I just couldn't find the right person.

132
00:13:11,340 --> 00:13:13,110
My body is off limits.

133
00:13:27,430 --> 00:13:29,410
What are you waiting for? Sign it.

134
00:13:44,830 --> 00:13:49,870
[General Ward A]

135
00:13:58,470 --> 00:14:04,120
[Kwon Seokmyeong]

136
00:14:16,450 --> 00:14:20,950
[Deposit: 30,000,000 won (~US$20,000)
Sender: Gu Seunghyuk]

137
00:14:46,050 --> 00:14:48,060
I'm glad you're here.

138
00:14:48,350 --> 00:14:49,710
I know how busy you are.

139
00:14:59,850 --> 00:15:03,430
Honey, don't be like this.

140
00:15:03,550 --> 00:15:05,550
It's been ages since you saw our son.

141
00:15:05,990 --> 00:15:08,970
Won't you take a look at him?

142
00:15:09,430 --> 00:15:11,130
What son?

143
00:15:11,900 --> 00:15:14,230
I don't have a son like him.

144
00:15:17,820 --> 00:15:19,570
Are you feeling better?

145
00:15:21,820 --> 00:15:23,340
Why are you here?

146
00:15:26,750 --> 00:15:28,320
I'm here to help Mom

147
00:15:28,570 --> 00:15:30,380
with something.

148
00:15:31,860 --> 00:15:34,640
Since I've seen you, I'll get going.

149
00:15:34,640 --> 00:15:35,990
Focus on your treatment, and—

150
00:15:35,990 --> 00:15:37,060
Are you...

151
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:41,090
still dating men?

152
00:15:55,340 --> 00:15:56,890
Take care.

153
00:15:58,750 --> 00:16:00,680
Wait, I'll come with you.

154
00:16:00,980 --> 00:16:03,590
That devil's child is still unrepentant!

155
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:05,470
Why would you ask him for help?

156
00:16:05,710 --> 00:16:07,170
Yihyun is right outside.

157
00:16:07,330 --> 00:16:08,670
Why must you...

158
00:16:10,670 --> 00:16:12,690
I'll go see him out.

159
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:23,060
Check if you've got the money.

160
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:24,200
I'm leaving.

161
00:16:24,340 --> 00:16:27,210
Yihyun, just a second.

162
00:16:28,140 --> 00:16:32,800
Let me pray for you.

163
00:16:37,770 --> 00:16:39,750
Heavenly Father,

164
00:16:39,870 --> 00:16:41,690
I sincerely thank you

165
00:16:41,830 --> 00:16:43,840
for bringing my precious son

166
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:45,830
back to me.

167
00:16:45,940 --> 00:16:50,270
Please protect him
from Satan's temptations...

168
00:16:54,400 --> 00:16:57,210
Lead him in the path of righteousness

169
00:16:59,170 --> 00:17:03,720
and deliver him from the crafty wiles...

170
00:17:09,089 --> 00:17:11,569
of the devil.

171
00:17:13,770 --> 00:17:15,000
Amen.

172
00:17:38,910 --> 00:17:40,260
Let's talk.

173
00:17:40,530 --> 00:17:41,800
I'm not in the mood.

174
00:17:42,190 --> 00:17:45,390
You've been ignoring my texts and calls.
What's going on?

175
00:17:45,700 --> 00:17:46,580
Yihyun,

176
00:17:46,580 --> 00:17:48,330
are you cutting me off like this?

177
00:17:48,330 --> 00:17:49,550
Soobin-hyung.

178
00:17:51,380 --> 00:17:53,240
Do you have no conscience?

179
00:17:54,220 --> 00:17:55,580
