182
00:18:04,100 --> 00:18:06,300
Since you're done using me,

183
00:18:06,610 --> 00:18:08,860
let's go our separate ways.

184
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:27,040
You've totally got the wrong idea, Yihyun.

185
00:18:28,180 --> 00:18:30,510
I really do like you.

186
00:18:54,450 --> 00:18:56,610
Is it because of Gu Seunghyuk?

187
00:19:06,880 --> 00:19:08,160
I knew it.

188
00:19:09,330 --> 00:19:12,590
I should've known when
you wouldn't tell me who he is to you.

189
00:19:13,280 --> 00:19:15,260
Why else would a sweet guy like you

190
00:19:16,040 --> 00:19:18,220
suddenly act out like this?

191
00:19:18,700 --> 00:19:20,480
It's because of that bastard.

192
00:19:25,200 --> 00:19:26,380
Don't!

193
00:19:26,550 --> 00:19:27,870
Stop!

194
00:19:32,290 --> 00:19:35,620
You just won't stop
getting on my freaking nerves, will you?

195
00:19:37,660 --> 00:19:39,080
Stop.

196
00:19:40,110 --> 00:19:41,140
Move.

197
00:19:41,360 --> 00:19:44,280
Soobin-hyung, leave.

198
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:46,100
Go!

199
00:19:54,570 --> 00:19:56,300
