201
00:20:00,890 --> 00:20:02,090
Wait,

202
00:20:02,840 --> 00:20:05,310
is this how you dealt with
that bastard too?

203
00:20:06,630 --> 00:20:07,920
What?

204
00:20:08,430 --> 00:20:10,590
Did you use such a meek tone

205
00:20:10,730 --> 00:20:13,290
when you told him to stop?

206
00:20:19,890 --> 00:20:22,950
Why aren't you saying anything?
I asked you a question.

207
00:20:26,810 --> 00:20:28,250
What if I did?

208
00:20:30,150 --> 00:20:31,470
What?

209
00:20:32,840 --> 00:20:34,740
Is that wrong?

210
00:20:42,950 --> 00:20:44,510
Gu Seunghyuk.

211
00:20:48,830 --> 00:20:50,610
Why don't you...

212
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:55,730
Why don't you

213
00:20:57,220 --> 00:20:58,870
sleep with me too?

214
00:21:15,120 --> 00:21:18,370
[Wintertime]

215
00:21:18,990 --> 00:21:21,850
There it is, the Kwon Yihyun I know.

216
00:21:22,120 --> 00:21:23,920
You said your body is off limits,

217
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:26,210
but what are the limits really?

218
00:21:26,360 --> 00:21:29,400
Name: Gu Jinhyuk.
Executive Vice President of Taesung Group.

219
00:21:29,400 --> 00:21:31,470
Get the address from his phone.

220
00:21:32,090 --> 00:21:34,700
See me in my office.

221
00:21:34,890 --> 00:21:36,830
Unlike me, he swings both ways.

222
00:21:36,980 --> 00:21:38,490
How could I not know?

223
00:21:38,720 --> 00:21:40,020
I'm not an idiot.

224
00:21:40,340 --> 00:21:41,710
Did you sleep with him?

225
00:21:42,130 --> 00:21:44,030
It's none of your business.

226
00:21:44,670 --> 00:21:46,890
You keep making me worry about you.
